# Say it with Flowers (windurst 50): a full bag. The Cacti give nothing (the quest returns nil: their default
# POISONOUS_LOOKING_BUDS); Moari's 520 gives no Iron Sword, so nothing happens and the cactus is kept; with room, 520
# completes the quest.
lists WindurstWaters/Moari-Kaaori/onTrade TahrongiCanyon/Tahrongi_Cacti/onTrigger WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/514 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/520
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=-251.5,-5.31,-226.9
quest Windurst.FoodForThought completed
quest Windurst.OvernightDelivery completed
fame Windurst 50
item TahrongiCactus
login
trigger Moari-Kaaori                    # 514
finish option=1                         # begun, Prog 1, SIWFSword 1
warp -307.2,7.48,264.45 TahrongiCanyon
fill-inventory
trigger Tahrongi_Cacti                  # no room: nil; POISONOUS_LOOKING_BUDS
warp -251.5,-5.31,-226.9 WindurstWaters
trade Moari-Kaaori TahrongiCactus x1    # SIWFSword 1: 520
finish                                  # no room for the sword: nothing
free-inventory
trade Moari-Kaaori TahrongiCactus x1    # 520
finish                                  # completed
